## Investor constraints

- Already retired (b. 19 Apr 1979); Brazil tax residency — **tax and structure scope only**
- USD ~200k at Interactive Brokers; irregular top-ups; withdrawals undecided
- Mandate: **preserve USD purchasing power** — real return vs **US CPI**. BRL translation, USD/BRL drift and IPCA are **out of scope**
- Universe: broad, liquid, low-TER equity / bond / inflation-linked ETFs
- **Excluded:** leveraged, inverse, thematic, illiquid, high-fee niche products

